                    <span class="badge trending-badge">🔥 Trending #1</span>
                    <span class="badge category-badge">TV Series</span>
                </div>
                <h1 class="hero-title">Sherlock</h1>
                <div class="hero-meta">
                    <span class="rating">⭐ 9.1 <i>/ 10</i></span>
                    <span class="meta-dot">•</span>
                    <span class="duration">4 Seasons • 13 Episodes</span>
                    <span class="meta-dot">•</span>
                    <span class="year">2010 – 2017</span>
                    <span class="meta-dot">•</span>
                    <span class="genre">Crime, Drama, Mystery</span>
                </div>
                <p class="hero-description">
                    A modern update finds the famous sleuth and his doctor partner solving crime in 21st century London,
                    utilizing sharp intellect, keen observation, and brilliant deduction.
                </p>
                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a href="/details" class="btn btn-primary">
                        <svg class="btn-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                            <path d="M8 5v14l11-7z" />
                        </svg>
